      "distinction":"In the same case of active supervision but defective ownership records, retained authority would not justify declaring paragraph 10 fulfilled: the substantive subject of responsibility remains deficient. Conversely, accurate vendor records alone do not show that the provider retained responsibility. The rival readings differ over what paragraph 10 itself demands, not whether separate record-keeping duties matter.",
