      "distinction":"A provider that has confirmed the specified matters but received no SFC request has no activated paragraph 14 demonstration requirement on this reading. Confirmation and underlying requirements continue. Paragraph 15 separately calls for obtaining third-party audit or verification on request; paragraph 16 calls for a satisfactory legal opinion supporting the application on request. Neither evidential method is automatically required by paragraph 14.",
